(7383156, 1158297, 30049, '<td valign="top">How did the shadow get so blue?  Did you push the blue saturation levels to enhance the water and the shadow was a side effect?  Other than that, I like the composition and subject matter.</td>', 'How did the shadow get so blue?  Did you push the blue saturation levels to enhance the water and the shadow was a side effect?  Other than that, I like the composition and subject matter.', '2015-07-06 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383158, 1157829, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ROT outtake.  :-)  Nice capture.  So, I have to ask, is that you with a remote, or a really good friend?</td>', 'Looks like a ROT outtake.  :-)  Nice capture.  So, I have to ask, is that you with a remote, or a really good friend?', '2015-07-06 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383162, 1153921, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The path to the moon shines upon the shore. Lovely capture of the illuminated path that the moon casts on this beach.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The path to the moon shines upon the shore. Lovely capture of the illuminated path that the moon casts on this beach.', '2015-07-06 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383164, 1158610, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Lovely light, beautiful orange-gold sky, and the the dynamic swish of the ocean waves curling around the rocky shore. I''m sure it was and even beautiful sight to behold in person. Lovely capture!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Lovely light, beautiful orange-gold sky, and the the dynamic swish of the ocean waves curling around the rocky shore. I''m sure it was and even beautiful sight to behold in person. Lovely capture!', '2015-07-06 23:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383165, 1157495, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great macro showcasing the details of these two mating insects!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great macro showcasing the details of these two mating insects!', '2015-07-06 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383166, 1158644, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the mystical mood here in this composition! The tree stands like a lone sentinel in the night as the magical blues blanket the landscape and the white clouds and moonlight swirl and shine to illuminate the eventide.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the mystical mood here in this composition! The tree stands like a lone sentinel in the night as the magical blues blanket the landscape and the white clouds and moonlight swirl and shine to illuminate the eventide.', '2015-07-06 23:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383168, 1157275, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A great photograph showing the ''Introduction'': beginnings of the sibling relationship. The eldest is not quite sure if happiness or wariness should be expressed when meeting the new baby. Great details and capture of the moment.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A great photograph showing the ''Introduction'': beginnings of the sibling relationship. The eldest is not quite sure if happiness or wariness should be expressed when meeting the new baby. Great details and capture of the moment.', '2015-07-06 23:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383172, 1156872, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the details and color of the horse and the barn (including the texture of the wood). I like how you captured the horse gazing at something in the distance for it makes your audience wonder what it is looking at. I think that this composition could be even better if the full frame of the door and the horse was in the composition as it just feels a bit too chopped as it is here.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the details and color of the horse and the barn (including the texture of the wood). I like how you captured the horse gazing at something in the distance for it makes your audience wonder what it is looking at. I think that this composition could be even better if the full frame of the door and the horse was in the composition as it just feels a bit too chopped as it is here.', '2015-07-06 23:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383176, 1157578, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great capture of this elephant reaching up to grab leaves off the top branch. There are some great details in the texture of the skin on the elephant; it would have made this shot even better is if there was a better balance of light and dark contrasts so that we get to see the head and eyes (as it is now that is lost in the shadow.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great capture of this elephant reaching up to grab leaves off the top branch. There are some great details in the texture of the skin on the elephant; it would have made this shot even better is if there was a better balance of light and dark contrasts so that we get to see the head and eyes (as it is now that is lost in the shadow.', '2015-07-06 23:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383185, 1158129, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I like this capture of this moment in the lives of the three woman in the cafe. You have a Mom drinking a soda sitting with her son; they are relaxed and dressed casually. Then there is the business woman who is dressed for success. We don''t see her face but her body seems tense and she seems to be conducting business perhaps on her smart phone. I wish we could see a bit more of her face for I feel it would add and strengthen the story here by showing what she is doing or what expression she wears. Then there is the elder woman off to the far left who is lost in thought with her hand on her chin; a classic thinking pose. Three woman, three different stages/paths in life. I see the poster that states ''Believe in the Dream'', but my eye was first and foremost drawn to the B&amp;W painting of Audrey Hepburn from the film Breakfast at Tiffany''s - to me she seems to be setting an appraising eye on these three woman.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I like this capture of this moment in the lives of the three woman in the cafe. You have a Mom drinking a soda sitting with her son; they are relaxed and dressed casually. Then there is the business woman who is dressed for success. We don''t see her face but her body seems tense and she seems to be conducting business perhaps on her smart phone. I wish we could see a bit more of her face for I feel it would add and strengthen the story here by showing what she is doing or what expression she wears. Then there is the elder woman off to the far left who is lost in thought with her hand on her chin; a classic thinking pose. Three woman, three different stages/paths in life. I see the poster that states ''Believe in the Dream'', but my eye was first and foremost drawn to the B&W painting of Audrey Hepburn from the film Breakfast at Tiffany''s - to me she seems to be setting an appraising eye on these three woman.', '2015-07-06 23:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383186, 1151887, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Nice bold red color on this lily and some great detail with the water drops on it''s petals.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Nice bold red color on this lily and some great detail with the water drops on it''s petals.', '2015-07-06 23:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383188, 1152062, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great textures on the wood slats of the building and details on the bicycle. The red is a great pop of color that contrasts nicely off of the weather-faded color of the wood.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great textures on the wood slats of the building and details on the bicycle. The red is a great pop of color that contrasts nicely off of the weather-faded color of the wood.', '2015-07-06 23:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383189, 1158894, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I like how the wood posts are composed in the frame to act as a leading line for the eye to discover the seabirds at rest and the two ships heading out to deep sea in the background.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I like how the wood posts are composed in the frame to act as a leading line for the eye to discover the seabirds at rest and the two ships heading out to deep sea in the background.', '2015-07-06 23:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383191, 1152846, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great capture of this sleeping panda. You captured some wonderful details on the light colored fur and it''s head. It could use a little more light/touch up on the front leg as that it is lost a bit too much in shadow and would be nice to see even more details of this lovely animal.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great capture of this sleeping panda. You captured some wonderful details on the light colored fur and it''s head. It could use a little more light/touch up on the front leg as that it is lost a bit too much in shadow and would be nice to see even more details of this lovely animal.', '2015-07-06 23:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
