(7383279, 1156867, 114285, '<td valign="top">Something about this, I keep coming back to it. A beautiful moment of exploration for a young child, so pleasantly composed I can''t fault it.<br/> <br/>This needs to be in an art gallery, it''s timeless, and it stays with you.<br/> <br/>My top pick, and it''s been a long time since I handed out one of these <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1070026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg"/></a> Thankyou.</td>', 'Something about this, I keep coming back to it. A beautiful moment of exploration for a young child, so pleasantly composed I can''t fault it. This needs to be in an art gallery, it''s timeless, and it stays with you. My top pick, and it''s been a long time since I handed out one of these  Thankyou.', '2015-07-07 04:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7383321, 1154800, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred background, but I think this would be more effective if it weren''t as blurred as it is.  At first glance, it just looks like toy planes on a rock.  It was only the title that made me realize the background.</td>', 'I like the blurred background, but I think this would be more effective if it weren''t as blurred as it is.  At first glance, it just looks like toy planes on a rock.  It was only the title that made me realize the background.', '2015-07-07 09:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
