(7384298, 1157495, 60173, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FocusPoint:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=669882" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/843/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_669882.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/843/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_669882.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/843/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_669882.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Time has changed it seems. 30 something place to 4th place! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you can''t be serious comparing this one to your shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The lighting and focus are much better with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=69324" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Marfun</a>''s shot. The real clincher is the eggs that complete the "Circle of Life". The story is more complete.</td>', 'Originally posted by h2: Originally posted by FocusPoint:   Time has changed it seems. 30 something place to 4th place!   you can''t be serious comparing this one to your shot   The lighting and focus are much better with  Marfun''s shot. The real clincher is the eggs that complete the "Circle of Life". The story is more complete.', '2015-07-08 12:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7384309, 1158260, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>1st of all let me say congrats on the ribbon. This shot is stunning. I am a sucker when it comes to waterfall shots. I love the water....the sky...oh and last but not least, the subject of the shot, the mountain. The only place in the shot that could use improvement is almost dead center. The sun is a bit bright there. For me that is pretty minor. Again congrats and happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... 1st of all let me say congrats on the ribbon. This shot is stunning. I am a sucker when it comes to waterfall shots. I love the water....the sky...oh and last but not least, the subject of the shot, the mountain. The only place in the shot that could use improvement is almost dead center. The sun is a bit bright there. For me that is pretty minor. Again congrats and happy shooting', '2015-07-08 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
