(7384413, 1158540, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow!  That''s some score.  And that nice shiny blue ribbon in a Free Study.  One of my top picks in the challenge.  One or both of us are becoming dangerously mainstream.... Oh.  Wait.  We both liked my FS, too, and it''s decidedly not a top contender.  There''s that.  (Congrats!!) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha! We can''t go losing our street cred...nope! We have to trickle a few high scores amongst all the middling ones just to keep people on their toes and perplexed.<br/> <br/>: D<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Wow!  That''s some score.  And that nice shiny blue ribbon in a Free Study.  One of my top picks in the challenge.  One or both of us are becoming dangerously mainstream.... Oh.  Wait.  We both liked my FS, too, and it''s decidedly not a top contender.  There''s that.  (Congrats!!)   Ha! We can''t go losing our street cred...nope! We have to trickle a few high scores amongst all the middling ones just to keep people on their toes and perplexed. : D', '2015-07-08 13:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
