(7384634, 1158174, 71489, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sidpixel:</b></div><hr/><i> *Hello from the Critique Club*<br/> <br/> The only minor criticism of the children is that the action he is making with the scissors being so close to the back of the child''s head make it look as though he is cutting her hair.<br/> <br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Haha! Thank you for that precise observation. I never saw that and now I cannot unsee it! :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for your critique. Good to know that there wasn''t a lot of wrongs with the image. Perhaps street photography is a bit tough to outscore the landscape long exposures that crowd the free studies.</td>', 'Originally posted by sidpixel: *Hello from the Critique Club*  The only minor criticism of the children is that the action he is making with the scissors being so close to the back of the child''s head make it look as though he is cutting her hair.   Haha! Thank you for that precise observation. I never saw that and now I cannot unsee it! :) Thanks for your critique. Good to know that there wasn''t a lot of wrongs with the image. Perhaps street photography is a bit tough to outscore the landscape long exposures that crowd the free studies.', '2015-07-08 21:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
