(7385392, 1157495, 58785, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FocusPoint:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=669882" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/843/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_669882.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/843/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_669882.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/843/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_669882.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Time has changed it seems. 30 something place to 4th place! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you can''t be serious comparing this one to your shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes I am... and I say it didn''t deserve 30+ spot but a better one...<br/> <br/>That was a long LOOONG time ago. Posted to show similarity of the images for most... placing rant comes second.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-07-10 20:29:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by h2: Originally posted by FocusPoint:   Time has changed it seems. 30 something place to 4th place!   you can''t be serious comparing this one to your shot   Yes I am... and I say it didn''t deserve 30+ spot but a better one... That was a long LOOONG time ago. Posted to show similarity of the images for most... placing rant comes second.', '2015-07-10 21:27:42.000000', '2015-07-10 21:29:08.000000', 0),
